<title>USA: Zitel sets two for one stock split.</title>
<headline>Zitel sets two for one stock split.</headline>
<dateline>FREMONT, Calif. 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zitel Corp said Friday it has approved a two-for-one split of its common stock.</p>
<p>The split will take effect as a stock dividend. The record date for the split will be November 18 and new shares will be issued on the payment date of November 27.</p>
<p>The action will increase the number of shares outstanding to about 15 million from about 7.5 million.</p>
<p>Zitel specializes in the design, manufacture and marketing of computerized storage systems.</p>
